Adapt investigation focus based on codebase type:
- **Modeling codebase** (training code, model definitions): model architectures, training loops, loss functions, optimizers, evaluation pipelines, metrics, experiment tracking, hyperparameter configs, and model artifacts.
- **Serving / business codebase** (inference endpoints, application logic): identify which models the service depends on, how they're loaded and invoked, latency/throughput requirements, business goals and requirements, feature serving paths, and what modeling improvements would most impact this service.
